// Shared build settings for every configuration of the NoteMap project.
//
// The Supabase URL and anon key live in `Supabase.xcconfig` next to this
// file — gitignored, the same way `.env.local` is for the web app. Copy
// `Supabase.example.xcconfig` to `Supabase.xcconfig` and fill it in.
// `#include?` (with the `?`) makes it optional, so a fresh clone still
// builds; the app then shows a "not configured" screen instead of failing
// to compile.
#include? "Supabase.xcconfig"

// Standard architectures on macOS are `arm64 x86_64`: Release builds
// (`ONLY_ACTIVE_ARCH = NO` in the project) produce one universal binary
// that runs natively on both Apple Silicon and Intel Macs. Debug builds
// only compile the architecture of the machine you're building on, which
// is Xcode's default and just keeps iteration fast.
ARCHS = $(ARCHS_STANDARD)
